  <item>
    <title>屎意盎然请到了厌女咖（反省中）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d5f8b89233b6e1210b7797</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62d5f8b89233b6e1210b7797</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Jul 2022 23:31:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>In 'The Woman-Identified Woman' lesbianism is inscribed as a political stance rather than a sexual identification: a lesbian is the rage of all women condensed to the point of explosion'. The Radicalesbians' paper aligns lesbians much more closely with heterosexual women than with male homosexuals, arguing that the hatred directed against lesbians is an effect of male domination:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lesbian is the word, the label, the condition that holds women in line... Lesbian is a label invented by the Man to throw at any woman who dares to be his equal, who dares to challenge his prerogatives, who dares to assert the primacy of her own need.</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客内容和shownote可以说是没有一点关系！</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为事发突然，主播不得不在一些热闹街道边暴走边录制，所以音质很差，大家听的时候小心点！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6206da899df69bbfdfea92e5/lvl2yH-13PghEQz_wrn1EIHA-SbL.mp3" length="18598101" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:24</itunes:duration>
